```{=html}
<ol class="pub-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
  <li class="pub-item">
    <div class="pub-body">
      <a class="pub-title" href="<%- item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a>
      <div class="pub-authors"><%= item.author %></div>
      <div class="pub-journal"><em><%= item.journal %></em><% if (item.date) { %>, <%= item.date.slice(-4) %><% } %></div>
    </div>
  </li>
<% } %>
</ol>
```
